n from a text prompt + the\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/schemas.py:125:    motion_strength: Optional[float] = None\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/schemas.py:315:    ``jump_still_requests`` and ``motion_clause``, which are stamped.\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/schemas.py:323:    not collapse), and a missing ``motion_clause`` means the pass never ran,\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/schemas.py:359:    #: The per-beat motion clause object (text/model/fallback/source_hash).\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/schemas.py:360:    motion_clause: Optional[dict] = None\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wan_shared.py:1:\"\"\"Shared PURE helpers for the two in-process Wan motion engines.\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wan_shared.py:21:Cold-import clean (V-12): module scope imports only the stdlib + motion_common\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wan_shared.py:29:from . import motion_common as _MC\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:1:\"\"\"Shared ComfyUI wrapper-node bridge for the in-process video motion engines.\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:3:The in-process motion engines (humo / ltx_video / wan_i2v) render by driving the\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:19:  * ffmpeg_silent_mp4_cmd / ffmpeg_still_motion_cmd / ffmpeg_lavfi_floor_cmd --\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:504:    length) extends here so the beat is FILLED with continuous motion instead of\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:511:    <= 0). A single frame cannot mirror into motion, so it is repeated (the caller\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:521:    if n < 2:                                   # no motion to mirror -> repeat\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:561:    render played in REVERSE. On a scene lane that is decorative motion and\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:611:    target (still motion/static, the lavfi floor) -- there ffmpeg is being told\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:624:def ffmpeg_still_motion_cmd(still_path, out_path, width, height, fps, frame_count,\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:646:    frames -> a silent bt709 clip. Unlike the slow-pan ``ffmpeg_still_motion_cmd``\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:650:    'I just want stills, no motion'. Deterministic; no RNG.\"\"\"\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:921:    The in-process motion engines feed a portrait / audio into the wrapper graph\r\nnodes/_otr_video_engines/wrapper_bridge.py:942:    \"ffmpeg_silent_mp4_cmd\", \"ffmpeg_still_motion_cmd\", \"ffmpeg_lavfi_floor_cmd\",\r\ntests/fixtures/fable2/legacy_reference_ledger.json:1326:    \"audio_motion_profile\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/fable2/legacy_reference_ledger.json:1401:  \"audio_motion_profiles\": [\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:67:  \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1761:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1796:      \"announcer_visual\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1797:      \"character_video\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1798:      \"music_visual\": \"still_motion\"\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1809:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1810:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1819:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1820:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1829:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:1830:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:4190:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:6325:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:8622:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:8658:      \"character_video\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:8680:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:8681:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11076:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11111:      \"announcer_visual\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11112:      \"character_video\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11113:      \"music_visual\": \"still_motion\"\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11124:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11125:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11134:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11135:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11144:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:11145:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13475:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13510:      \"announcer_visual\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13511:      \"character_video\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13512:      \"music_visual\": \"still_motion\"\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13523:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13524:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13533:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13534:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13543:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:13544:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15884:   \"still_motion\": {\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15919:      \"announcer_visual\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15920:      \"character_video\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15921:      \"music_visual\": \"still_motion\"\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15932:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15933:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15942:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15943:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15952:      \"effective_engine\": \"still_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:15953:      \"family\": \"static_motion\",\r\ntests/fixtures/still_plan_head_parity.json:17095:  \"still_motion\": [\r\ntests/test_audio_motion_foldin.py:2:and OTR_VideoRenderBatch._stamp_audio_motion_profiles durably stamps them\r\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
